.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
.Dd October 28, 2026
.Dt NOQTIS-ALGS 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm noqtis-algs
.Nd list the algorithms noqtis provides and their sizes
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm noqtis algs
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm noqtis algs
prints a table with one row per signature algorithm
.Pq type Ql sig
and per key encapsulation mechanism
.Pq type Ql kem :
its name, the public key, secret key and signature or ciphertext sizes in
bytes, and for a KEM the shared-secret size.
The names are those
.Xr noqtis-keygen 1
accepts and key files carry; the sizes are those of
.Fn nqssize
and
.Fn nqksize
.Pq Xr nqsign 3 , Xr nqenc 3 .
.Sh EXIT STATUS
0, or 2 on a usage error.
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
$ noqtis algs
algorithm              type      pk      sk  sig/ct   ss
ML-DSA-44              sig     1312    2560    2420    -
ML-DSA-65              sig     1952    4032    3309    -
ML-DSA-87              sig     2592    4896    4627    -
SLH-DSA-SHA2-128s      sig       32      64    7856    -
\&...
ML-KEM-768             kem     1184    2400    1088   32
\&...
HQC-256                kem     7237    7333   14421   32
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr noqtis 1 ,
.Xr nqenc 3 ,
.Xr nqsign 3
